<section id="tab1" class="panel active fade-in" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t1">
<h3 class="fadeInUp animatable">Paediatric Dentistry</h3>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">Our Paediatric Dentistry Department is dedicated to the oral health of infants, children, and adolescents, including those with complex medical conditions or special healthcare needs. With a child-centred approach, advanced dental technologies, and a focus on preventive care, we ensure that every child receives gentle, comprehensive, and developmentally appropriate dental treatment.</p>
<p class="pt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Our Specialised Services Include:</p>
<div class="workup-sec mt-3">
<h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">Diagnostic Work Up</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Comprehensive Dental Assessment</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Detailed evaluation of teeth, gums, bite, oral hygiene habits, and jaw development to identify early signs of decay, enamel defects, gum disease, and orthodontic concerns.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Digital Dental Imaging</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Low-radiation paediatric X-rays, panoramic imaging, and intraoral scanners to detect cavities, assess developing teeth, and plan precise treatments.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Growth and Development Monitoring</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Regular assessments to track tooth eruption, bite alignment, jaw growth, and early orthodontic needs.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Preventive Dental Care</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Fluoride Treatments</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Professional fluoride applications to strengthen enamel and prevent early childhood caries.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Dental Sealants</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Protective coatings applied to molars to reduce the risk of decay in deep grooves and pits.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Oral Hygiene Education</h5>
</div>
<p>Personalised brushing and flossing guidance for children and parents to establish long-term healthy habits.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Dietary Counselling</h5>
</div>
<p>Advice on nutrition and feeding practices that support oral health, including caries prevention in infants and toddlers.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Interventional and Advanced Management</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no"><img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/PaediatricDentistry.png"></li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Restorative Dentistry</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Management of tooth decay using child-friendly materials and techniques, including composite fillings, stainless steel crowns, and aesthetic restorations.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Pulp Therapy</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Treatment of infected or traumatised primary teeth through pulpotomy or pulpectomy, preserving natural tooth function.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Management of Dental Trauma</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Urgent and ongoing care for chipped, fractured, dislodged, or knocked-out teeth, including splinting and follow-up rehabilitation.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Extractions</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Safe removal of severely decayed, impacted, or non-restorable teeth, performed with careful consideration of future dental development.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Space Maintainers</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Custom-made devices to preserve arch space after early tooth loss and prevent future alignment issues.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Sedation and Behavioural Management</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Behaviour Guidance Techniques</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Non-pharmacological strategies such as tell-show-do, desensitisation, and positive reinforcement to reduce anxiety and build trust.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Inhalation Sedation (Nitrous Oxide)</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>A safe, mild sedative option to help anxious children undergo dental procedures comfortably.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>General Anaesthesia Dental Care</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Comprehensive dental treatment under general anaesthesia for children with extensive dental needs, severe anxiety, or special healthcare requirements.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Medical Management and Specialised Clinics</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Early Childhood Caries Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Focused care for infants and toddlers with severe or recurrent dental decay, incorporating treatment and parental education.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Special Needs Dentistry</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Tailored dental care for children with developmental, behavioural, or medical conditions, ensuring accessibility, safety, and continuity of care.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Orthodontic Screening and Interceptive Care</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Early detection of bite problems and implementation of interceptive measures such as habit-breaking appliances, expanders, and growth guidance.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Oral Medicine and Soft Tissue Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Diagnosis and management of oral ulcers, gum diseases, mucosal lesions, and congenital abnormalities affecting the tongue, lips, and oral cavity.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Rehabilitation, Follow-Up and Family Support</h4>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">We provide ongoing follow-up to maintain oral health, monitor tooth development, and prevent relapse of dental conditions. Our team emphasises family education, early intervention, and a holistic approach to ensure every child enjoys lasting oral health and a positive dental experience.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-5 fadeInUp animatable">
<h4>We have dedicated clinic for</h4>
</div>
